WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.461
Repetition matters because skill improves through repeated attempts, feedback, and correction.

2
00:00:04.461 --> 00:00:08.112
A single explanation or demonstration rarely creates reliable performance.

3
00:00:08.112 --> 00:00:16.223
Repetition gives the learner multiple chances to notice the cue, make the decision, perform the step, and compare the result.

4
00:00:16.223 --> 00:00:23.524
It also helps parts of the skill become more fluent so attention can move to higher-level judgment.

5
00:00:23.524 --> 00:00:27.985
Exact repetition is useful early, but it is not always enough.

6
00:00:27.985 --> 00:00:35.691
If every practice attempt looks the same, the learner may memorize the surface pattern without understanding the underlying principle.

7
00:00:35.691 --> 00:00:38.530
Variation helps the skill become more flexible.

8
00:00:38.530 --> 00:00:49.076
Change the example, the context, the difficulty, the timing, or the constraints so the learner has to recognize what matters rather than copy a fixed script.

9
00:00:49.076 --> 00:00:53.537
Practicing edge cases is especially useful when real work includes ambiguity.

10
00:00:53.537 --> 00:00:57.187
A strong troubleshooter needs more than the clean example.

11
00:00:57.187 --> 00:01:00.838
A strong communicator needs more than the friendly audience.

12
00:01:00.838 --> 00:01:04.488
A strong analyst needs more than the obvious signal.

13
00:01:04.488 --> 00:01:13.005
Variation teaches the learner how the skill behaves when conditions shift, evidence is incomplete, or the usual shortcut no longer works.

14
00:01:13.005 --> 00:01:14.627
Transfer is the goal.

15
00:01:14.627 --> 00:01:21.928
The learner should be able to apply the skill in a different task, context, or real-world situation.

16
00:01:21.928 --> 00:01:31.256
Retrieval and recall can support that transfer by asking learners to bring back the principle without the answer sitting in front of them.

17
00:01:31.256 --> 00:01:32.473
Repetition builds stability.

18
00:01:32.473 --> 00:01:33.690
Variation builds adaptability.

19
00:01:33.690 --> 00:01:38.557
Together they reduce brittle skill that only works in one familiar scenario.
